  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Tina has always known there was an audience. She has always performed
      for it.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The mask and the face have reached an arrangement. Tina finds she prefers
      the arrangement.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: This is the final scene. Tina has rehearsed it. The blocking is very
      clear.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: She thanks you for attending. The performance continues through all
      conditions.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
